{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3d95vBRDN6ctZ5Jefo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into a stone wall.*\n\n*There is a keyhole, dark and waiting.*\n\n*You hold a key.*\n\n*The metal slides in. It fits perfectly — as if it were always meant to. The tumblers turn with a sound like a whispered secret finally spoken aloud.*\n\n**click.**\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor lit by no visible source, the air warm and smelling faintly of old books and rain on dust. The floor is worn smooth by countless feet before yours.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":136,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}